{"id":"bai-7-tu-khoa-define-va-typedef-trong-c","chapterId":"chuong-1","chapterNumber":1,"chapterTitle":"NHẬP MÔN C++ & KỸ NĂNG SINH TỒN TRONG CONTEST","order":7,"lessonNumber":7,"title":"Bài 7 Từ khóa define và typedef trong C++","wordCount":164,"estimatedMinutes":3,"headings":[{"level":2,"text":"1. define","id":"1-define"},{"level":3,"text":"Định nghĩa hằng số","id":"dinh-nghia-hang-so"},{"level":3,"text":"Định nghĩa macro (có tham số)","id":"dinh-nghia-macro-co-tham-so"},{"level":3,"text":"Macro hay dùng trong thi đấu","id":"macro-hay-dung-trong-thi-dau"},{"level":2,"text":"2. typedef","id":"2-typedef"},{"level":3,"text":"C++11 trở lên: dùng using thay thế","id":"c-11-tro-len-dung-using-thay-the"},{"level":2,"text":"So sánh nhanh","id":"so-sanh-nhanh"}],"contentHtml":"<h2 id=\"1-define\">1. define</h2><p>Là chỉ thị tiền xử lý (preprocessor directive), thay thế <strong>trực tiếp văn bản</strong> trước khi biên dịch — không có kiểu dữ liệu, không tốn bộ nhớ biến.</p>\n<h3 id=\"dinh-nghia-hang-so\">Định nghĩa hằng số</h3><pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"ln\">1</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\">#</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">define</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\"> </span><span class=\"tk tk-k\">PI</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\"> </span><span class=\"tk tk-n\">3.14159</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">2</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\">#</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">define</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\"> </span><span class=\"tk tk-k\">MAXN</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\"> </span><span class=\"tk tk-n\">100005</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">3</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">4</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">double</span> dt <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> PI <span class=\"tk tk-t\">*</span> r <span class=\"tk tk-t\">*</span> r<span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">5</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> a<span class=\"tk tk-t\">[</span>MAXN<span class=\"tk tk-t\">]</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span></code></pre><h3 id=\"dinh-nghia-macro-co-tham-so\">Định nghĩa macro (có tham số)</h3><pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"ln\">1</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\">#</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">define</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\"> </span><span class=\"tk tk-s\">MAX</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\">a</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">,</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\"> b</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\"> </span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\">a</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\"> </span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">&gt;</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\"> </span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\">b</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\"> </span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">?</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\"> </span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\">a</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\"> </span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">:</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\"> </span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\">b</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">2</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\">#</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">define</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\"> </span><span class=\"tk tk-s\">SQR</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\">x</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\"> </span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\">x</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\"> </span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">*</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\"> </span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\">x</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">3</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">4</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> m <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-s\">MAX</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-n\">3</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">,</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">7</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>      <span class=\"tk tk-c\">// (3) &gt; (7) ? (3) : (7)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">5</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> s <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-s\">SQR</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-n\">5</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>          <span class=\"tk tk-c\">// ((5) * (5))</span></code></pre><p><strong>Lưu ý:</strong> luôn đặt ngoặc quanh tham số macro, vì <code>#define</code> chỉ thay thế văn bản thô — thiếu ngoặc dễ gây lỗi thứ tự phép toán.</p><pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"tk tk-k\">#</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">define</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\"> </span><span class=\"tk tk-s\">SQR</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\">x</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\"> x </span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">*</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\"> x</span>\n<span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> s <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-s\">SQR</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-n\">1</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">+</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">2</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>   <span class=\"tk tk-c\">// thành 1 + 2 * 1 + 2 = 5 (SAI, mong muốn là 9)</span></code></pre><h3 id=\"macro-hay-dung-trong-thi-dau\">Macro hay dùng trong thi đấu</h3><pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"tk tk-k\">#</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">define</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\"> </span><span class=\"tk tk-k\">fastio</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\"> </span><span class=\"tk tk-k\">ios_base</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\">::</span><span class=\"tk tk-s\">sync_with_stdio</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-n\">false</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\"> cin</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">.</span><span class=\"tk tk-s\">tie</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\">NULL</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"tk tk-k\">#</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">define</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\"> </span><span class=\"tk tk-k\">ll</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\"> </span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">long</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\"> </span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">long</span>\n<span class=\"tk tk-k\">#</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">define</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\"> </span><span class=\"tk tk-k\">endl</span><span class=\"tk tk-k\"> </span><span class=\"tk tk-f\">\"\\n\"</span></code></pre><h2 id=\"2-typedef\">2. typedef</h2><p>Đặt <strong>bí danh (alias)</strong> cho một kiểu dữ liệu, giúp code ngắn gọn và dễ đọc hơn — có kiểu dữ liệu thật sự, được trình biên dịch kiểm tra.</p><pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"ln\">1</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">typedef</span> <span class=\"tk tk-v\">long</span> <span class=\"tk tk-v\">long</span> ll<span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">2</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">typedef</span> pair pii<span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">3</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">typedef</span> vector vi<span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">4</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">5</span>ll x <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">1000000000000</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">6</span>pii p <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span><span class=\"tk tk-n\">1</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">,</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">2</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">7</span>vi a <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span><span class=\"tk tk-n\">1</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">,</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">2</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">,</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">3</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span></code></pre><h3 id=\"c-11-tro-len-dung-using-thay-the\">C++11 trở lên: dùng <code>using</code> thay thế</h3><pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"tk tk-v\">using</span> ll <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-v\">long</span> <span class=\"tk tk-v\">long</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"tk tk-v\">using</span> pii <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> pair<span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span></code></pre><h2 id=\"so-sanh-nhanh\">So sánh nhanh</h2><div class=\"lesson-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Tiêu chí</th><th><code>#define</code></th><th><code>typedef</code> / <code>using</code></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Bản chất</td><td>Thay thế văn bản (preprocessor)</td><td>Đặt tên kiểu (được compiler hiểu)</td></tr><tr><td>Kiểm tra kiểu</td><td>Không</td><td>Có</td></tr><tr><td>Dùng cho</td><td>Hằng số, macro có tham số</td><td>Bí danh kiểu dữ liệu</td></tr><tr><td>Gỡ lỗi</td><td>Khó hơn (lỗi khó truy vết)</td><td>Dễ hơn</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p><strong>Khuyến nghị:</strong> dùng <code>typedef</code>/<code>using</code> cho kiểu dữ liệu, dùng <code>#define</code> cho hằng số và macro tiện ích ngắn.</p>"}